  "prompt": "For each month of the first quarter of 2025, what was the total net revenue, and how much of it came from Gaming? Use the sales table and its order_month column, the first day of the month the order was placed in. Count only order lines with an order_date from 2025-01-01 to 2025-03-31, both included. Return three columns, in this order: order_month, revenue_eur, the sum of net_revenue_eur, and gaming_revenue_eur, the sum of net_revenue_eur over the lines whose parent_category is 'Gaming'. Lines with a missing net_revenue_eur add nothing, and a month with no Gaming revenue shows 0, not a missing value. Return one row per order_month. Do not round. Any row order is fine.",
